ss=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2014</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 국가근로장학생 추가 신청을 다음과 같이 안내합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">* </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 중 국가근로 추가선발계획은 없으나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">방학 중 국가근로 희망부서신청자격이 주어집니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. (</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">부서신청은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">12</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월중 공지예정</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">* 1</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">차때 신청완료된 학생은 신청인원에 포함되어 있으므로 재신청 불가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신규자만 신청가능</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">온라인 신청 후 서약서는 학교</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">[</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생처 본관</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">101</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">호</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">로 반드시 제출해야 합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. [1-8</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">번 참조</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">] (</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">미제출시 신청 취소됨</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 2014-1</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 국가근로 신청기간</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"